Here is the commit message:
ACCUMULO-3937 Allow configuration in killing a tserver due to
 HDFS failures

Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug is that the TabletServer was hardcoded to halt after encountering a fixed number (5) of write-ahead log (WAL) creation errors within 10 seconds, which did not allow for flexibility in varying operational conditions or workloads. This could lead to premature termination of the TabletServer in scenarios where failure rates were higher than anticipated due to transient issues, without the possibility of configuration adjustments by the user.

